    "preamble": "Sirigidi Prasad vs The State Of A.P., on 7 August, 2020 Author: Ninala Jayasurya Bench: Ninala Jayasurya Honourable Sri Justice Ninala Jayasurya Criminal Petition No.2820 of 2020 Order:",
    "facts": "This Criminal Petition is filed under Section 482 of the Code of Criminal Procedure, 1973 seeking to quash all further proceedings in F.I.R. No.716 of 2019, dated 13.12.2019 on the file of Station House Officer, Anakapalli Town Police Station, Visakhapatnam, against the petitioner/ accused No.5. The petitioner is accused No.5 in Crime No.716 of 2019. The said crime has been registered against the petitioner and others for the alleged offences punishable under Sections 307, 353, 328, 270, 273 read with Sections 34 and 109 of IPC and Section 59(1) of Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006.",
